{"headword":"פֶּ֫רֶץ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 30:14\" href=\"/Job.30.14\">Jb 30:14</a></sup> <strong>bursting forth, breach</strong>; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:15\" href=\"/Judges.21.15\">Ju 21:15</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּ֑רֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:29\" href=\"/Genesis.38.29\">Gn 38:29</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.20\">2 S 5:20</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרָצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:3\" href=\"/Amos.4.3\">Am 4:3</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרָצוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.5\">Ez 13:5</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּרְצֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:11\" href=\"/Amos.9.11\">Am 9:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרָצֶיהָ</span> We Now);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>bursting forth, outburst</em>, of water <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.20\">2 S 5:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.11\">1 Ch 14:11</a>; from womb <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:29\" href=\"/Genesis.38.29\">Gn 38:29</a> (J)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>breach</em> in wall <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:3\" href=\"/Amos.4.3\">Am 4:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.27\">1 K 11:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.1\">Ne 6:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:14\" href=\"/Psalms.144.14\">ψ 144:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:14\" href=\"/Job.30.14\">Jb 30:14</a>; so (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדַר</span>, i.e. repair) <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:11\" href=\"/Amos.9.11\">Am 9:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.12\">Is 58:12</a>; fig. of effort to avert calamity, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָה בַּפְּרָצוֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.5\">Ez 13:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדַר</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">עָמַד בַּפֶּרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.30\">22:30</a> (‖ id.), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:23\" href=\"/Psalms.106.23\">ψ 106:23</a>, by instruction and (especially) intercession."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>broken wall</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ נֹפֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.13\">Is 30:13</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. of <em>outburst</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s wrath, acc. cogn. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרַץ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.8\">2 S 6:8</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.11\">1 Ch 13:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 16:14\" href=\"/Job.16.14\">Jb 16:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(פֶרֶץ עַל־פְנֵי־פָ֑רֶץ)</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשָׂה פ׳ בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:15\" href=\"/Judges.21.15\">Ju 21:15</a>."}],"num":"4."}]},"rid":"BDB08102","strong_numbers":["6556","6557","6560"],"next_hw":"פֶּ֫רֶץ²","prev_hw":"פָּרַץ","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","quotes":[],"GK":["7288","7289"],"TWOT":["1826a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}